{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Uh Oh Airlines is a silly, casual, single player or couch co-op flight attendant simulator where you and a friend perform normal flight attendant duties, but must also wrangle your passengers to make it through the day. Through four unique seasons and many special flights and events, keep calm and fly on.<br><br>In this demo, you can play up through day 7 of the calendar and through day 11 of endless mode! To access more content, join our discord server and sign up for the playtest!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Save data from this demo will not transfer over to the playtest or the full game upon release.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This game is in alpha and is subject to rapid, major iteration.\u00a0</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3582760?t=1753379901","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3582760?t=1753379901","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3582760/be5b3cc6651122a8b2f8a6f4a97b7ec3734383e6/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1753379901","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3582760/be5b3cc6651122a8b2f8a6f4a97b7ec3734383e6/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1753379901","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen Co-op","id":39},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Remote Play Together","id":44}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Uh Oh Airlines is a silly, casu